{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_007_02_e",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:f0634c7a78a1d64a341a5653b15405e8ef4b904455962c268e16132b685d2c2b",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0caba00123987c65267cb553eff1c391af5c1350a25058166325804f0b0c7b21",
      "text": "生日当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:382d4ef1e28dc4129caf51f7a3dd60f17040b4113c3988c5c590559ce7fd8304",
      "text": "……曲毕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f208f35b4aa4f622ca1f20fce27822942d18ea5908cf4a1c255d073cefbcd7c",
      "text": "是维瓦尔第呢。太美妙了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:707ef38f7c7d2823517b603e54165a5dd4a322dbfb6f910ba3f370ef2161e08b",
      "text": "是的。《四季》中的\n第一首《春》，第一乐章《快板》……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c1e1fd7ce557215052d8d12b68b3c215dfa2e92c186ec99d3a162a859d6e2de",
      "text": "因为这是一首宣告春日来临的乐曲，\n我认为非常适合都筑先生的生日，便选了这首。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67c9da8760e2ae8e73d5ba9e440c386d9562296682b4950994b181b39deeb329",
      "text": "欢快悦动、满怀祝福的声音……\n度过了一段非常惬意的时光呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc82c0397ba41e1c81d45c51eb7c0552ce4feaf1ffb52a10d9444271af007bf9",
      "text": "谢谢你美妙的演奏，丽先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb2c011fcf813017cbbf3e6285ae3a592bf166e0288e9b77fdfe737b09541d10",
      "text": "圭先生，祝您生日快乐。\n难得的好日子，我还准备了蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88da75f52235ef069cd2da6a8e24185befe195f50a05dc5f330668709ecc5055",
      "text": "虽然特意选了比较小份的……\n不嫌弃的话请尝尝看吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dfa751d187251562ccad238979085825642f9f26ee2c01de59e9369c6947670f",
      "text": "谢谢。既然是来自二位的心意，\n我会努力吃完的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_007kei_02_1_2_007_02:1_2_007_02_e:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8b2dabde05711f018a57ccddae044e4e6fb2431b89dfb0d156a3c1719d33631e",
      "text": "再次祝都筑先生，\n今天生日快乐。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
